<body language="English">
	<row id="msg_0474_T04R0401_00000" index="0">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Long time ago, this HARD kid rode my\nBike around, and that started a whole\fBike boom.\rThen I opened a branch in Goldenrod.\rAnd it started sellin’ like CRAZY!\rBut now nobody come to THIS shop. My\nown branch stole my customers.\rAll I got left is a bike pump...\rShould I sell pool floaties? I’m\nthinkin’ pool floaties.</language>
	</row>
</body>
